---
import RuntimeArchitecture from "../RuntimeArchitecture/RuntimeArchitecture.astro";
---

<!-- is-visible starts the sync pulse; this page has no scroll reveal. -->
<section class="mac-runtime is-visible" aria-labelledby="runtime-title">
  <div class="mac-runtime__intro">
    <h2 id="runtime-title">The Mac app is a window into the same record.</h2>
    <p>
      Crona for macOS connects to the local daemon alongside the CLI and TUI, so issues, sessions,
      check-ins, and day boundaries stay shared.
    </p>
    <a class="mac-text-link" href="https://docs.crona.work/workflows/macos-companion/"
      >Read the Mac app architecture <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
    >
  </div>
  <RuntimeArchitecture highlight="mac" />
</section>
